pe":"heading","depth":3,"id":"rendercodeblockdata","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"renderCodeBlockData"}]},{"type":"code","value":"function renderCodeBlockData(options: {\n  code: string\n  decorations?: HighlightOptions['decorations']\n  lang?: string\n  lineNumbers?: boolean\n  title?: string\n}): RenderedCodeBlockData","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Trims trailing whitespace from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"code"},{"type":"text","value":", highlights it, and returns "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"copyText"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"htmlMarkup"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"lang"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"title"},{"type":"text","value":", and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tokens"},{"type":"text","value":" for a code block component."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"types","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Types"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"highlightlanguage","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"HighlightLanguage"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A union of every canonical language name included by this entry point. See the "},{"type":"link","href":"../language-support","children":[{"type":"text","value":"language matrix"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"highlightresult","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"HighlightResult"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The core "},{"type":"link","href":"core#highlightresult","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"HighlightResult"}]},{"type":"text","value":" narrowed so "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"lang"},{"type":"text","value":" is "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"HighlightLanguage"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"highlighttokenresult","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"HighlightTokenResult"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The core "},{"type":"link","href":"core#highlighttokenresult","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"HighlightTokenResult"}]},{"type":"text","value":" narrowed so "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"lang"},{"type":"text","value":" is "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"HighlightLanguage"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"renderedcodeblockdata","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RenderedCodeBlockData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The core "},{"type":"link","href":"core#renderedcodeblockdata","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RenderedCodeBlockData"}]},{"type":"text","value":" narrowed so "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"lang"},{"type":"text","value":" is "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"HighlightLanguage"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"rendercodeblockoptions","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RenderCodeBlockOptions"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"core#highlightoptions","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"HighlightOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":" plus an optional "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"title"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"core-re-exports","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Core re-exports"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The default entry also exports "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createHighlighter"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"defineLanguage"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"escapeHtml"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"renderNodesToHtml"},{"type":"text","value":", and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"renderTokens"},{"type":"text","value":", along with these types: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Highlighter"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"HighlightDecoration"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"HighlightDecorationData"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"HighlightElementNode"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"HighlightLineDecoration"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"HighlightOptions"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"HighlightRangeDecoration"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"HighlightRenderNode"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"HighlightTextNode"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"HighlightToken"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"HighlightTokenClass"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"LanguageDefinition"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TokenRange"},{"type":"text","value":", and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TokenizerContext"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Their contracts are documented in the "},{"type":"link","href":"core","children":[{"type":"text","value":"core reference"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Importing only these core helpers lets a compatible bundler remove the all-language registry. The bound convenience functions above retain it."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"default-entry","text":"Default Entry","level":1},{"id":"values","text":"Values","level":2},{"id":"alllanguages","text":"allLanguages","level":3},{"id":"defaulthighlighter","text":"defaultHighlighter","level":3},{"id":"functions","text":"Functions","level":2},{"id":"normalizelanguage","text":"normalizeLanguage","level":3},{"id":"listlanguages","text":"listLanguages","level":3},{"id":"tokenize","text":"tokenize","level":3},{"id":"highlight","text":"highlight","level":3},{"id":"highlighttohtml","text":"highlightToHtml","level":3},{"id":"rendercodeblockdata","text":"renderCodeBlockData","level":3},{"id":"types","text":"Types","level":2},{"id":"highlightlanguage","text":"HighlightLanguage","level":3},{"id":"highlightresult","text":"HighlightResult","level":3},{"id":"highlighttokenresult","text":"HighlightTokenResult","level":3},{"id":"renderedcodeblockdata","text":"RenderedCodeBlockData","level":3},{"id":"rendercodeblockoptions","text":"RenderCodeBlockOptions","level":3},{"id":"core-re-exports","text":"Core re-exports","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Default Entry\n\n`@tanstack/highlight` registers every bundled language and exposes a ready-to-use singleton. It also re-exports the public core API.\n\n```ts\nimport {\n  highlight,\n  highlightToHtml,\n  listLanguages,\n  normalizeLanguage,\n  renderCodeBlockData,\n  tokenize,\n} from '@tanstack/highlight'\n```\n\n## Values\n\n### `allLanguages`\n\nA readonly tuple containing all bundled [`LanguageDefinition`](core#languagedefinition) objects. Its order is stable and matches [`listLanguages`](#listlanguages).\n\n### `defaultHighlighter`\n\nThe [`Highlighter`](core#highlighter) used by every convenience function in this entry point. Its fallback is `plaintext`.\n\n## Functions\n\n### `normalizeLanguage`\n\n```ts\nfunction normalizeLanguage(lang?: string): HighlightLanguage\n```\n\nReturns the canonical registered language name for a name or alias. Names are trimmed and lowercased. Unknown or omitted values resolve to `plaintext`.\n\n### `listLanguages`\n\n```ts\nfunction listLanguages(): Array<HighlightLanguage>\n```\n\nReturns the 39 canonical language names registered in `defaultHighlighter`.\n\n### `tokenize`\n\n```ts\nfunction tokenize(code: string, options?: HighlightOptions): HighlightTokenResult\n```\n\nReturns normalized language information and semantic tokens without rendering HTML.\n\n### `highlight`\n\n```ts\nfunction highlight(code: string, options?: HighlightOptions): HighlightResult\n```\n\nReturns `code`, `lang`, `tokens`, and a complete escaped `<pre><code>` string in `html`.\n\n### `highlightToHtml`\n\n```ts\nfunction highlightToHtml(code: string, options?: HighlightOptions): string\n```\n\nReturns only the HTML produced by `highlight`.\n\n### `renderCodeBlockData`\n\n```ts\nfunction renderCodeBlockData(options: {\n  code: string\n  decorations?: HighlightOptions['decorations']\n  lang?: string\n  lineNumbers?: boolean\n  title?: string\n}): RenderedCodeBlockData\n```\n\nTrims trailing whitespace from `code`, highlights it, and returns `copyText`, `htmlMarkup`, `lang`, `title`, and `tokens` for a code block component.\n\n## Types\n\n### `HighlightLanguage`\n\nA union of every canonical language name included by this entry point. See the [language matrix](../language-support).\n\n### `HighlightResult`\n\nThe core [`HighlightResult`](core#highlightresult) narrowed so `lang` is `HighlightLanguage`.\n\n### `HighlightTokenResult`\n\nThe core [`HighlightTokenResult`](core#highlighttokenresult) narrowed so `lang` is `HighlightLanguage`.\n\n### `RenderedCodeBlockData`\n\nThe core [`RenderedCodeBlockData`](core#renderedcodeblockdata) narrowed so `lang` is `HighlightLanguage`.\n\n### `RenderCodeBlockOptions`\n\n[`HighlightOptions`](core#highlightoptions) plus an optional `title`.\n\n## Core re-exports\n\nThe default entry also exports `createHighlighter`, `defineLanguage`, `escapeHtml`, `renderNodesToHtml`, and `renderTokens`, along with these types: `Highlighter`, `HighlightDecoration`, `HighlightDecorationData`, `HighlightElementNode`, `HighlightLineDecoration`, `HighlightOptions`, `HighlightRangeDecoration`, `HighlightRenderNode`, `HighlightTextNode`, `HighlightToken`, `HighlightTokenClass`, `LanguageDefinition`, `TokenRange`, and `TokenizerContext`.\n\nTheir contracts are documented in the [core reference](core).\n\nImporting only these core helpers lets a compatible bundler remove the all-language registry. The bound convenience functions above retain it.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Default Entry\n---\n\n# Default Entry\n\n`@tanstack/highlight` registers every bundled language and exposes a ready-to-use singleton. It also re-exports the public core API.\n\n```ts\nimport {\n  highlight,\n  highlightToHtml,\n  listLanguages,\n  normalizeLanguage,\n  renderCodeBlockData,\n  tokenize,\n} from '@tanstack/highlight'\n```\n\n## Values\n\n### `allLanguages`\n\nA readonly tuple containing all bundled [`LanguageDefinition`](core#languagedefinition) objects. Its order is stable and matches [`listLanguages`](#listlanguages).\n\n### `defaultHighlighter`\n\nThe [`Highlighter`](core#highlighter) used by every convenience function in this entry point. Its fallback is `plaintext`.\n\n## Functions\n\n### `normalizeLanguage`\n\n```ts\nfunction normalizeLanguage(lang?: string): HighlightLanguage\n```\n\nReturns the canonical registered language name for a name or alias. Names are trimmed and lowercased. Unknown or omitted values resolve to `plaintext`.\n\n### `listLanguages`\n\n```ts\nfunction listLanguages(): Array<HighlightLanguage>\n```\n\nReturns the 39 canonical language names registered in `defaultHighlighter`.\n\n### `tokenize`\n\n```ts\nfunction tokenize(code: string, options?: HighlightOptions): HighlightTokenResult\n```\n\nReturns normalized language information and semantic tokens without rendering HTML.\n\n### `highlight`\n\n```ts\nfunction highlight(code: string, options?: HighlightOptions): HighlightResult\n```\n\nReturns `code`, `lang`, `tokens`, and a complete escaped `<pre><code>` string in `html`.\n\n### `highlightToHtml`\n\n```ts\nfunction highlightToHtml(code: string, options?: HighlightOptions): string\n```\n\nReturns only the HTML produced by `highlight`.\n\n### `renderCodeBlockData`\n\n```ts\nfunction renderCodeBlockData(options: {\n  code: string\n  decorations?: HighlightOptions['decorations']\n  lang?: string\n  lineNumbers?: boolean\n  title?: string\n}): RenderedCodeBlockData\n```\n\nTrims trailing whitespace from `code`, highlights it, and returns `copyText`, `htmlMarkup`, `lang`, `title`, and `tokens` for a code block component.\n\n## Types\n\n### `HighlightLanguage`\n\nA union of every canonical language name included by this entry point. See the [language matrix](../language-support).\n\n### `HighlightResult`\n\nThe core [`HighlightResult`](core#highlightresult) narrowed so `lang` is `HighlightLanguage`.\n\n### `HighlightTokenResult`\n\nThe core [`HighlightTokenResult`](core#highlighttokenresult) narrowed so `lang` is `HighlightLanguage`.\n\n### `RenderedCodeBlockData`\n\nThe core [`RenderedCodeBlockData`](core#renderedcodeblockdata) narrowed so `lang` is `HighlightLanguage`.\n\n### `RenderCodeBlockOptions`\n\n[`HighlightOptions`](core#highlightoptions) plus an optional `title`.\n\n## Core re-exports\n\nThe default entry also exports `createHighlighter`, `defineLanguage`, `escapeHtml`, `renderNodesToHtml`, and `renderTokens`, along with these types: `Highlighter`, `HighlightDecoration`, `HighlightDecorationData`, `HighlightElementNode`, `HighlightLineDecoration`, `HighlightOptions`, `HighlightRangeDecoration`, `HighlightRenderNode`, `HighlightTextNode`, `HighlightToken`, `HighlightTokenClass`, `LanguageDefinition`, `TokenRange`, and `TokenizerContext`.\n\nTheir contracts are documented in the [core reference](core).\n\nImporting only these core helpers lets a compatible bundler remove the all-language registry. The bound convenience functions above retain it.\n"}
